      "name": "Evidence gathering and provenance",
      "summary": "Five-step research and authoring-provenance workflow executed whenever a research or authoring agent investigates a topic: decompose topic areas and shortlist needed papers and datasets, query accessible scholarly and data APIs (Crossref/DOI, arXiv, PubMed, I…",
      "description": "Five-step research and authoring-provenance workflow executed whenever a research or authoring agent investigates a topic: decompose topic areas and shortlist needed papers and datasets, query accessible scholarly and data APIs (Crossref/DOI, arXiv, PubMed, InspireHEP, OpenAlex, Semantic Scholar, Google Scholar, and reference data registries), ingest retrieved references, texts, and datasets into the declared Knowledge Graph subgraphs via Process_Ingestion, assess relevancy and claim boundaries against the opened sources, and record retrieval/verification provenance in authoring notes alongside formal citations in authored blocks.",
      "enforcement": "advisory",
